              authentication.

       --HH _U_R_I Specify  URI(s) referring to the ldap server(s); only the proto‐
              col/host/port fields are allowed; a list of  URI,  separated  by
              whitespace or commas is expected.

       --hh _l_d_a_p_h_o_s_t
